    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_004_01",
      "hash64": "93AEF6B5DB5A8D28",
      "text": "Je vous félicite pour votre victoire contre Éra !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_004_02",
      "hash64": "93AEF9B5DB5A9241",
      "text": "Maintenant que vous avez obtenu le Badge\\nd’Éra, vous pouvez participer à une version\\r\\nspéciale du Roule-Olive !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_004_03",
      "hash64": "93AEF8B5DB5A908E",
      "text": "Dans celle-ci, vous serez chronométré[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_004_04",
      "hash64": "93AEFBB5DB5A95A7",
      "text": "Et si vous faites rouler votre boule assez vite,\\nvous recevrez une belle récompense !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_004_05",
      "hash64": "93AEFAB5DB5A93F4",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous essayer la version spéciale\\ndu Roule-Olive ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_004_chose_1",
      "hash64": "4FB821B325D7CD5D",
      "text": "Oui !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_004_chose_2",
      "hash64": "4FB81EB325D7C844",
      "text": "Quel est mon record ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_004_chose_3",
      "hash64": "4FB81FB325D7C9F7",
      "text": "Une prochaine fois, peut-être.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_004_chose_1_after",
      "hash64": "2A420F8B49E0B7AC",
      "text": "Parfait ! Et pensez à nous souhaiter une bonne\\nrécolte pendant que vous poussez la boule !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_004_chose_2_after",
